  m_text: 'A pair flagged Persist is not cross-faded: the spinning block is the very
    object that lands on the panel, its spin never restarting, and the copies swap
    places when the transition ends. A persisting object keeps its own sizing, so
    each side sizes a slot for it. Click the card or the panel.'
